12. WINDOW FUNCTIONS
==================================================

Query:
SELECT first_name, last_name, department, salary,
       RANK() OVER (
           PARTITION BY department
           ORDER BY salary DESC
       ) AS dept_salary_rank
FROM employees_lab15
ORDER BY department, dept_salary_rank;

