16. CUSTOM SORTING WITH CASE
==================================================

Query:
SELECT product_name, status
FROM orders_lab15
ORDER BY
    CASE status
        WHEN 'High Priority' THEN 1
        WHEN 'Medium Priority' THEN 2
        WHEN 'Low Priority' THEN 3
        ELSE 4
    END,
    product_name;

 product_name | status
--------------+-----------------
 Keyboard     | High Priority
 Laptop       | High Priority
 Laptop       | High Priority
 Keyboard     | Medium Priority
 Monitor      | Medium Priority
 Mouse        | Medium Priority
 Monitor      | Low Priority
 Mouse        | Low Priority

(8 rows)

